{"seq":14,"slug":"micro-frontends","title":"微前端架构","stage":"DONE","category":"frontend","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/micro-frontends","rating":{"composite":3.54,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4.4,"coverage":3,"positioning":4,"strategic":2.67},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.15,"verdict":"skip-for-this-profile","uScore":1.75}},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"微前端架构-简介\">微前端架构 简介</h1><p>微前端架构把大型前端应用拆成多个可独立开发、测试、部署的小型应用，让多个团队在同一产品上并行迭代而不互相阻塞。本知识库不停留在「微前端是什么」，而是系统讲清<strong>怎么拆、怎么集成、用什么框架、如何工程化落地</strong>这条完整链路，重点放在隔离、共享与部署这三个最难的工程问题上。</p>\n<h2 id=\"本-hub-的定位与边界\">本 hub 的定位与边界</h2><p>前端知识库中有多处涉及微前端，分工如下，避免重复阅读：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>知识库</th>\n<th>定位</th>\n<th>何时看</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><strong>本 hub（微前端架构）</strong></td>\n<td>微前端的<strong>专题深潜</strong>：集成模式、主流框架原理、沙箱/样式隔离、共享依赖、跨应用通信与部署</td>\n<td>真正要落地或深入一个微前端方案时</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../frontend-engineering/\">前端工程化 · 微前端章节</a></td>\n<td>工程化全景里的<strong>入门概览</strong>，篇幅短</td>\n<td>只想快速了解微前端在工程化中的位置</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../frontend-architecture-patterns/\">前端架构模式 · 联邦与组合</a></td>\n<td>从<strong>架构模式</strong>视角看联邦/组合/远程组件，与渲染架构、迁移策略并列</td>\n<td>做整体架构决策、对比多种架构风格时</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>简言之：<strong>要选型和理解全局架构去「前端架构模式」，要动手实现某个微前端方案就留在本 hub。</strong></p>\n<h2 id=\"前置知识\">前置知识</h2><p>阅读本知识库建议先具备：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>React 或 Vue 等主流框架的实战经验（理解组件、路由、生命周期）。</li>\n<li>基本的构建工具知识，尤其是 <a href=\"../build-toolchain/bundlers/webpack-core-concepts\">Webpack 核心概念</a> 与 <a href=\"../build-toolchain/foundations/module-systems-and-resolution\">模块系统与解析</a>——Module Federation 与依赖外部化都建立在此之上。</li>\n<li>一点分布式系统直觉会很有帮助：微前端的拆分、契约、容错思路大量借鉴 <a href=\"../../cs-fundamentals/distributed-systems/microservices/service-decomposition\">服务拆分与边界</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"内容结构\">内容结构</h2><p>全书四章，从「该不该做」走到「怎么做好」：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>微前端概念</strong>——定义、设计原则、与单体的对比，帮你先判断是否值得引入。</li>\n<li><strong>集成模式</strong>——运行时集成、构建时集成、iframe 与 Web Components，理解集成时机的取舍。</li>\n<li><strong>微前端框架</strong>——Module Federation、single-spa、qiankun 与无界的原理与选型。</li>\n<li><strong>工程实践</strong>——共享依赖、跨应用通信、独立部署，解决落地中最棘手的问题。</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"推荐学习路径\">推荐学习路径</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>架构决策者 / 技术负责人</strong>：第一章全读 → 第三章「框架选型」与第四章「部署策略」。先想清楚是否该上、组织能否承接，再看落地代价。重点对照 <a href=\"../frontend-architecture-patterns/architecture-evolution/technology-selection-framework\">技术选型决策框架</a>。</li>\n<li><strong>要动手落地的工程师</strong>：第二章 → 第三章选定一个框架精读（多数团队从 <a href=\"mfe-frameworks/module-federation\">Module Federation 模块联邦</a> 起步）→ 第四章按需查阅。</li>\n<li><strong>从单体渐进迁移的团队</strong>：先读 <a href=\"mfe-concepts/mfe-vs-monolith\">微前端与单体架构对比</a> 与 <a href=\"mfe-concepts/mfe-overview\">微前端概述</a>，确认「模块化单体」是否已够用，再决定是否运行时拆分。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>建议先理解概念与原则，再选集成模式与框架，最后深入工程实践——避免一上来就陷进框架细节而忽略了「是否真的需要微前端」这一步。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"mfe-concepts","title":"微前端概念","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/micro-frontends/mfe-concepts","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"mfe-overview","title":"微前端概述","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/micro-frontends/mfe-concepts/mfe-overview"},{"seq":2,"slug":"mfe-design-principles","title":"微前端设计原则","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/micro-frontends/mfe-concepts/mfe-design-principles"},{"seq":3,"slug":"mfe-vs-monolith","title":"微前端与单体架构对比","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/micro-frontends/mfe-concepts/mfe-vs-monolith"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"integration-patterns","title":"集成模式","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/micro-frontends/integration-patterns","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"runtime-integration","title":"运行时集成","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/micro-frontends/integration-patterns/runtime-integration"},{"seq":2,"slug":"build-time-integration","title":"构建时集成","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/micro-frontends/integration-patterns/build-time-integration"},{"seq":3,"slug":"iframe-webcomponents","title":"iframe 与 Web Components 集成","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/micro-frontends/integration-patterns/iframe-webcomponents"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"mfe-frameworks","title":"微前端框架","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/micro-frontends/mfe-frameworks","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"module-federation","title":"Module Federation 模块联邦","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/micro-frontends/mfe-frameworks/module-federation"},{"seq":2,"slug":"single-spa","title":"single-spa 框架","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/micro-frontends/mfe-frameworks/single-spa"},{"seq":3,"slug":"qiankun-wujie","title":"qiankun 与无界","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/micro-frontends/mfe-frameworks/qiankun-wujie"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"mfe-engineering","title":"工程实践","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/micro-frontends/mfe-engineering","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"shared-dependencies","title":"共享依赖管理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/micro-frontends/mfe-engineering/shared-dependencies"},{"seq":2,"slug":"cross-app-communication","title":"跨应用通信","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/micro-frontends/mfe-engineering/cross-app-communication"},{"seq":3,"slug":"mfe-deployment","title":"微前端部署策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/micro-frontends/mfe-engineering/mfe-deployment"}]}]}